                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/domaindrivendev/Swashbuckle.AspNetCore/releases/tag/v11.0.0"&gt;v11.0.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h1&gt;Swashbuckle.AspNetCore v11.0.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-important"&gt;&lt;p class="markdown-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-report mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Important&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This release contains major breaking changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read our &lt;a href="https://github.com/domaindrivendev/Swashbuckle.AspNetCore/blob/HEAD/docs/migrating-to-v11.md"&gt;v11 migration guide&lt;/a&gt; for further information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With this release, Swashbuckle.AspNetCore adds support for generating OpenAPI 3.2 documents and for ASP.NET Core 11.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Swashbuckle.AspNetCore v11 depends on &lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/OpenAPI.NET/releases/tag/v3.11.0"&gt;OpenAPI.NET v3.11&lt;/a&gt; which introduces some breaking changes to the public API surface. More information can be found in their &lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/OpenAPI.NET/blob/main/docs/upgrade-guide-3.md"&gt;OpenAPI.NET v3 Upgrade Guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To reduce the number of breaking behavioural changes in Swashbuckle.AspNetCore v11, generation of OpenAPI 3.1 and 3.2 documents is &lt;strong&gt;opt-in&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
To generate OpenAPI 3.1 or 3.2 documents, change the OpenAPI version as shown in the code snippet below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="app.UseSwagger(options =&amp;gt;
{
    options.OpenApiVersion = OpenApiSpecVersion.OpenApi3_1;
    // ...or
    options.OpenApiVersion = OpenApiSpecVersion.OpenApi3_2;
});"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;UseSwagger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;options &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;OpenApiVersion&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;OpenApiSpecVersion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;OpenApi3_1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-c"&gt;// ...or&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;OpenApiVersion&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;OpenApiSpecVersion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;OpenApi3_2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-tip"&gt;&lt;p class="markdown-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-light-bulb mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.32.985-2.304 0-2.06-1.637-3.75-4-3.75ZM5.75 12h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM6 15.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Tip&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is strongly recommended that you upgrade to &lt;a href="https://github.com/domaindrivendev/Swashbuckle.AspNetCore/releases/tag/v10.3.1"&gt;Swashbuckle.AspNetCore v10.3.1&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;before&lt;/strong&gt; upgrading to v11.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
